  "//removed-deps-4-c-021": [
    "[Fix 4-c-021 · Task Local-C & ARC-03 Remediation] Removed unused dependencies",
    "and deprecated prisma dual database ecosystem. Direct database access from Next.js",
    "is retired; the single source of truth for all data mutations and state is the",
    "FastAPI TaskKernel over HTTP with Capability Token.",
    "",
    "Removed (19 deps — zero imports anywhere under src/):",
    "  - @dnd-kit/core, @dnd-kit/sortable, @dnd-kit/utilities  (no drag-and-drop)",
    "  - @mdxeditor/editor                                    (no MDX editor)",
    "  - @reactuses/core                                      (no @reactuses imports)",
    "  - framer-motion                                        (no framer-motion imports)",
    "  - next-auth                                            (no next-auth imports)",
    "  - next-intl                                            (no next-intl imports)",
    "  - z-ai-web-dev-sdk                                     (no z-ai-web-dev-sdk imports)",
    "  - @tanstack/react-query                                (no @tanstack/react-query imports)",
    "  - @tanstack/react-table                                (no @tanstack/react-table imports)",
    "  - react-syntax-highlighter                             (no imports; fix-diff-viewer.tsx uses raw <pre>)",
    "  - react-markdown                                       (no imports)",
    "  - date-fns                                             (no imports — Calendar primitive uses react-day-picker directly)",
    "  - uuid                                                  (no imports)",
    "  - zustand                                               (no imports — theme store uses useSyncExternalStore)",
    "  - zod                                                   (no imports)",
    "  - @hookform/resolvers                                  (no imports — form.tsx primitive does not use zod resolver)",
    "  - @prisma/client, prisma                                (ARC-03 remediation: direct DB access removed in favor of HTTP API)",
    "",
    "Kept deps that ARE imported by shadcn primitives (each primitive may itself",
    "be unused — removing the primitive is a separate cleanup task; removing",
    "the dep would break the primitive source today):",
    "  - next-themes            (components/ui/sonner.tsx)",
    "  - input-otp              (components/ui/input-otp.tsx)",
    "  - react-resizable-panels (components/ui/resizable.tsx)",
    "  - react-day-picker       (components/ui/calendar.tsx)",
    "  - recharts               (components/ui/chart.tsx)",
    "  - embla-carousel-react   (components/ui/carousel.tsx)",
    "  - vaul                   (components/ui/drawer.tsx)",
    "  - cmdk                   (components/ui/command.tsx)",
    "  - sonner                 (components/ui/sonner.tsx)",
    "  - react-hook-form        (components/ui/form.tsx)"
  ]
}
